      "writtenOn": "2016-09-08T00:29:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Shawn: Can we make it common code as all the BD9995* users will call same code? We can add additional ifdef to decide GPIO or TCPC.",
      "revId": "67c874d65e35330869869634c0196cdf1f3458d7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
