    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f68dffb6_231a4e79",
        "filename": "board/kevin/usb_pd_policy.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 55,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-08T03:59:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is that true? They may all call pd_set_vbus_discharge(), but not necessarily set_discharge_gpios() correct? Isn\u0027t it up to the board to define whether they want to use these GPIOs or the TCPCs? They could do that using CONFIG_* options.\n\nHowever, I could see other boards in the future wanting to set discharge. That code would probably be identical to what\u0027s here, so I vote for moving it to common/usb_pd_policy.c.",
      "parentUuid": "f68dffb6_dd0fcb36",
      "revId": "67c874d65e35330869869634c0196cdf1f3458d7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f68dffb6_1ffafe5d",
        "filename": "board/kevin/usb_pd_policy.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 55,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001696
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-09-08T21:40:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will move the code to common/usb_pd_policy.c. We\u0027ll need to implement TCPC routines to set discharge state (already done in pending CL) and get present discharge state (not done yet I think).",
      "parentUuid": "f68dffb6_231a4e79",
      "revId": "67c874d65e35330869869634c0196cdf1f3458d7",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f68dffb6_400d90eb",
        "filename": "board/kevin/usb_pd_policy.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 72,
