      "message": "if (interrupts \u0026 BD99955_CMD_INT_SET_TH_RES \u0026\u0026\n    vbus \u003c BD99955_VBUS_DISCHARGE_TH)\n    pd_set_vbus_discharge(bd99955_pd_port_to_chg_port(port), 1);\n\nif (interrupts \u0026 BD99955_CMD_INT_SET_TH_DET \u0026\u0026\n    vbus \u003e BD99955_VBUS_DISCHARGE_TH)\n    pd_set_vbus_discharge(bd99955_pd_port_to_chg_port(port), 0);",
      "revId": "67c874d65e35330869869634c0196cdf1f3458d7",
